<title>USA: Energy Research gets biomass-fuel cell work.</title>
<headline>Energy Research gets biomass-fuel cell work.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy Research Corp said it has been awarded three contracts to evaluate biomass fuels for power generation using its direct, carbonate fuel cells.</p>
<p>Under a contract with Chariton Valley Resource Conservation and Development Inc of Centerville, Iowa, the company will evaluate the feasibility of a biomass gasification/fuel cell power generation system.</p>
</text>
